&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Credit-based and consumption-based offerings are becoming central to how GitLab monetizes. The systems that meter, rate, and bill that consumption sit underneath all of it. You&#39;ll own the backend usage billing pipeline and its product direction while supporting the Monetization Platform and Infrastructure team as it modernizes the foundations underneath it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When another GitLab team launches a credit-consuming capability, you&#39;ll help them make it billable across GitLab.com, self-managed, and GitLab Dedicated. This is a technical, systems-oriented product role: success means building a monetization platform other teams can launch on quickly and correctly, rather than shipping customer-facing UI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product direction for metering, aggregation, and rating in GitLab&#39;s usage billing pipeline, including the Zuora and CustomersDot integrations that turn usage into invoiced revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make onboarding a new credit-consuming capability a repeatable process rather than a bespoke project each time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product teams on what to instrument, how to meter and price usage across GitLab.com, self-managed, and GitLab Dedicated, and what it takes to be billable on launch day. Stay ahead of their roadmaps so billing doesn&#39;t delay launches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize pipeline scalability, performance, and reliability as consumption grows, balancing those investments against new capability enablement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own billing defect detection and remediation so errors surface before they reach a customer&#39;s invoice and billing outcomes remain auditable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Monetization Platform and Infrastructure team by framing problems, explaining the value of platform investments, and prioritizing them against operational risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track measures of billing accuracy, pipeline reliability, cost to serve per capability, and time to monetize so teams can make informed pricing decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning the product direction of consumption- or usage-based billing systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Zuora or a comparable billing and revenue platform, and an understanding of how product and finance systems interact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with prepaid, commitment, or credit-drawdown pricing models (balances, reservations, overage, expiration) and the edge cases they create in billing and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience launching new products or pricing models while coordinating across engineering, Finance, Legal, Compliance and go-to-market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to bring together teams you don&#39;t manage around work their launches depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining problems for platform or backend teams whose users are often other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication in an all-remote, asynchronous environment; you&#39;ll use issues, epics, and direction pages to lead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with developer tooling, financial audit or revenue recognition, or an engineering background can help, but isn&#39;t required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You use AI tools as part of how you work: prototyping, analysis, spec writing, and investigation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Monetization, we coordinate across engineering, Finance, Legal, Compliance and go-to-market on new products and pricing models. Our remote, asynchronous work uses written issues, and epics to keep decisions visible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_actions__container c-message__actions&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: xx-small;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;Remote-Global&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Scopely is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Manager, CRM&lt;/strong&gt; to join our MONOPOLY GO! game team in our Barcelona studio on a hybrid basis (3X in office), or remotely within the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Scopely, we care deeply about what we do and want to inspire play, every day - whether in our work environments alongside our talented colleagues, or through our deep connections with our communities of players. We are a global team of game lovers who are developing, publishing and innovating the mobile games industry, connecting millions of people around the world daily.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MONOPOLY GO! is a global phenomenon and the biggest mobile game launch in history, captivating millions of players worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a passionate and experienced Senior Product Manager to shape how Monopoly GO! connects with players throughout their journey, solving complex product challenges and creating communication experiences that are more relevant, timely, and valuable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Product Manager for CRM, you’ll own the vision and roadmap for the capabilities, tools, and experiences that power communication throughout the player journey. You’ll identify player and business needs, translate them into product opportunities, and lead cross-functional teams to discover, build, and continuously improve scalable CRM solutions for a leading live-service mobile game.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and lead the CRM product roadmap and strategy across player-facing experiences and internal tooling, translating player, business, behavioural, and market insights into strategic priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve engagement, retention, reactivation, and player value, while shaping the future of CRM across push, email, in-game messaging, Live Activities, and emerging channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion relevant, contextual, personalised, and player-first communication experiences while serving as a senior product voice and CRM subject-matter expert across the organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap, Discovery and Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery and ideation to identify player needs, team pain points, and opportunities to evolve CRM, while leading a cross-functional product area with dedicated software engineering resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear product direction, priorities, requirements, and success criteria to guide execution, and own delivery outcomes from discovery and prioritisation through development, launch, measurement, and iteration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve CRM capabilities including personalisation, automation, segmentation, decisioning, orchestration, and dynamic content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance and Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the analytics team to monitor and report on program effectiveness, using data-driven insights to recommend continuous improvement and keep players at the heart of every decision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead structured testing strategies across A/B testing, cadence, segmentation, and channel mix, while championing a strong test-and-learn culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in Product Management or a related product discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product experience in gaming is strongly preferred; experience in entertainment or mobile apps is also relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of player lifecycle and contact strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset and confidence using data to identify opportunities and guide decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cross-functional collaboration skills and comfort working in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A player-first mindset and a drive to keep improving product and communication strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Braze or a similar marketing automation platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with tools such as Looker&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with live-service, casual, or social games&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Scopely&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely is a leading video game and global interactive entertainment company, home to many of the world’s most beloved and enduring experiences, including two of the most successful mobile games of all-time “MONOPOLY GO!” and “Pokémon GO,” along with “Stumble Guys,” “Star Trek™ Fleet Command,” “MARVEL Strike Force,” “WWE Champions,” the Scrabble® franchise, “Yahtzee® With Buddies,” and many others. Across mobile, web, PC, and console, Scopely creates, develops, publishes, and live-operates one of the most diversified and award-winning portfolios in the games industry — bringing hundreds of millions of players together through a shared love of play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2011, Scopely is powered by its exceptional team — including thousands of world-class gamemakers around the globe, a distinctive tenet-driven culture, and its proprietary technology platform, Playgami. Together, these strengths have fueled Scopely’s position as the #1 mobile games company in the U.S. and #2 globally, generating more than $10 billion in lifetime revenue. Whether building global sensations like “MONOPOLY GO!” from the ground up, or expanding through strategic acquisitions, including the FoxNext, GSN, and Scopely Explore games businesses — Scopely consistently delivers experiences players love today and return to for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized multiple times as one of the &quot;100 Most Influential Companies in the World&quot; by TIME magazine and one of Fast Company&#39;s &quot;World&#39;s Most Innovative Companies&quot; and “Best Workplaces for Innovators,” Scopely believes that video games can be a force for good — creating meaningful connections, vibrant communities, and making life better through play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scopely has global operations and partners across four continents in more than a dozen countries worldwide. For more information, visit: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/&quot;&gt;https://www.scopely.com/&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notice to Candidates: Scopely will never request payment or financial information during the application or hiring process. Please apply only through our official &lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt; and verify that all Talent Partner communications come from an email address ending in @&lt;a href=&quot;http://scopely.com&quot;&gt;scopely.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you have any questions or encounter any fraudulent requests/emails/websites, please immediately contact ----- Our job applicant privacy policies are available here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/job-applicant-privacy-notice-for-ca-residents&quot;&gt;California Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scopely.com/en/eea-and-uk-job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;EEA/UK Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment at Scopely is based solely on a person&#39;s merit and qualifications. Scopely does not discriminate against any employee or applicant because of race, creed, color, religion, gender, sexual orientation, gender identity/expression, national origin, disability, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, pregnancy or related condition (including breastfeeding), or any other basis protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records, consistent with applicable federal, state and local law.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Vault Solutions Engineer collaborates closely with Veeam’s field sellers to evangelize the Vault product offering, providing expertise to inform, educate, and influence end users, partners and internal teams about the Vault product and technology. You’ll have the opportunity to work at the intersection of data resilience, security, Vault, and public cloud platforms. Responsibilities include effectively presenting Veeam’s Vault technology and sharing technical expertise with diverse decision-makers at various levels. you’ll engage in strategic customer situations where advanced technical knowledge, architectural guidance, and domain expertise directly shape outcomes. You’ll have broad visibility across customer environments and business priorities, making this role especially compelling for candidates who enjoy solving complex challenges, influencing senior stakeholders, and helping customers build resilient architectures for the future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll bring expertise across traditional infrastructure, public cloud platforms, virtualization technologies, and cyber resilience architectures, helping customers protect and recover data wherever their applications and workloads reside.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: France remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Functions:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the core sales department to develop Veeam Vault opportunities to technical win&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct live and virtual customer meeting presentations and demonstrations&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the customer/partner to&amp;nbsp;establish&amp;nbsp;and translate business&amp;nbsp;objectives&amp;nbsp;into technical requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently consult with customer base to provide technical&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;on Vault solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product Management to provide customer feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing pre-sales support to customers as they evaluate Veeam software                                                       &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide&amp;nbsp;others in resolving complex issues in&amp;nbsp;specialized area based on existing solutions or procedures&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support lead generation activities such as events, webinars, user groups, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted technical advisor for strategic customer accounts, providing specialized expertise across data resilience, security, Vault, and public cloud platforms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead architecture reviews, resilience assessments, operational readiness reviews, and solution validation engagements to identify risks, gaps, and opportunities to improve resilience and recoverability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage technical and executive stakeholders on resilience strategy, cyber recovery preparedness, public cloud modernization, and operational best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance on protecting and recovering workloads across virtual, physical, public cloud, SaaS, and hybrid environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess customer architectures and advise on data protection, disaster recovery, cyber resilience, and secure recovery strategies across public cloud and enterprise environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze telemetry, platform adoption trends, and operational indicators to identify optimization opportunities and expansion signals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Customer Success, Sales Engineering, Product Management, and Support teams to resolve complex technical challenges and advocate for customer outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical workshops, executive briefings, and strategic advisory sessions that drive adoption and long-term customer success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a subject matter expert in Vault, public cloud data protection, cyber resilience, and secure recovery strategies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The qualifications below include both core requirements and preferred experience. Candidates do not need to meet every preferred qualification to be considered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in technical consulting, solution architecture, cloud engineering, customer success, infrastructure engineering, or related technical disciplines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in public cloud platforms, cyber resilience, Vault, data protection technologies, or enterprise infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, deploying, supporting, or advising on public cloud environments, including AWS, Azure, and hybrid cloud architectures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud architecture, identity and access considerations, security best practices, and modern infrastructure design principles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with backup, recovery, disaster recovery, cyber resilience, secure recovery, or cyber vaulting strategies across public cloud and enterprise environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hybrid cloud, virtualization, storage, networking, and enterprise infrastructure.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to engage technical and executive stakeholders and translate complex technical concepts into business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience conducting architecture reviews, technical assessments, workshops, proofs of concept, or strategic advisory engagements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, troubleshooting, and problem-solving skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and stakeholder management capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a technical discipline or equivalent practical experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred: Relevant certifications such as AWS, Azure, VMware, security, or equivalent credentials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13029&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20ce0acc&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days plus &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;RTT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13172&quot; data-local-id=&quot;42878605&quot;&gt;Mandatory public health insurance with broad medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13237&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3db28b9e&quot;&gt;Employer-paid private medical, dental, optical, and wellness plan through Axa, with options for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13347&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6db259ba&quot;&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage above the Social Security ceiling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13422&quot; data-local-id=&quot;53633940&quot;&gt;State and supplementary pension contributions by Veeam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;13480&quot; data-local-id=&quot;19bfbf32&quot;&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;If the applicant is permanently present outside France, Veeam reserves the right to decline consideration of the application for the job. A remote job is only possible in case the employee is located in France.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-JB1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
